halsey is bursting with love after  revealing  she's pregnant  [Music]  the 26 year old singer announced the  news on instagram wednesday  sharing three images of her growing baby  bump  she tagged actor producer aylev aiden on  her belly  leading fans to speculate he is the  baby's father  aylev reposted halsey's image to his  instagram story  and also left this sweet comment quote  heart so full i love you sweetness  halsey replied i love you and i love  this mini human  already i am very happy  fans have also noticed that halsey is  wearing a rainbow crochet crop top  and included a rainbow emoji in her  caption  which could be a reference to a rainbow  baby a baby born after a miscarriage or  infant death  i was on tour i found out i was pregnant  and before i could even really  figure out what that meant to me and  what that meant for my future  for my career for my life my  relationship  the next thing i knew i was on stage  miscarrying  in the middle of my concert that's  halsey on an episode of the doctors in  2018  opening up about her struggle with  endometriosis and  suffering pregnancy loss when i finally  got my endometriosis diagnosis was with  dr aliabadi she took one look at me and  i explained her  my symptoms and she said you have  endometriosis and it was so bittersweet  because it was like the relief  of knowing i wasn't making it all up and  i wasn't being sensitive  and it wasn't all in my head but it also  kind of sucked to  know that i was going to be living with  this forever thankfully halsey seems to  be happy  healthy and ready to tackle motherhood i  remind myself that you know  if i'm doing well and the people i love  are happy and taken care of then  everything is good becoming a parent is  something she opened up to rolling stone  about in 2016  telling the mag quote i want to be a mom  more than i want to be a pop star  more than i want to be anything in the  world
 

